  "solution": "Hàm số đã cho liên tục trên các khoảng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có \n\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tĐể hàm số liên tục trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>ℝ</mi></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>*</mo><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> <br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> là hữu hạn. <br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là nghiệm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> thì <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tThay vào <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>*</mo><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
